now open and trading.

62
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,880
He's applied for upper floors
to become a hotel, and

63
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:12,700
once that's approved, he's
looking at a yield well over 10%.

64
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,060
So one letter led to a sale, a building

65
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:17,600
that's earning again, and
the company I run today.

66
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:20,920
Off-market gets misunderstood, so
it's worth being clear about it.

67
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,080
It doesn't mean cheap.

68
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,080
We don't sell below
market value properties.

69
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:28,020
Every building we sell is valued
on its income, its condition and

70
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:30,640
its location, the same as
it would be on a portal.

71
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,050
It isn't a secret club
either, it's knocking on

72
00:03:33,050 --> 00:03:35,480
the door before the for sale sign goes up.

73
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,160
What it gives a buyer is time.

74
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:41,280
The investors on our list see a building
before it's advertised anywhere public.

75
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,880
If it isn't under offer by
then, it goes to a full

76
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:47,560
public launch, and everyone else sees
it after they've had first look.

77
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:51,290
The buyers who get these buildings are
rarely the ones with the most money.

78
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:52,720
They're the ones who are ready.

79
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,000
There are four things to have in place.

80
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,850
First, your criteria.

81
00:03:54,850 --> 00:03:57,230
Write down the areas and
the type of building,

82
00:03:57,230 --> 00:04:00,000
your price range and the
minimum yield you'd expect.

83
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:03,720
If you can't say it in one sentence,
an agent can't match you to anything.

84
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,590
Then there's finance.

85
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:07,270
Have an agreement in principle or proof of

86
00:04:07,270 --> 00:04:10,160
funds before you view,
not after you offer.

87
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:12,020
There's also your solicitor.

88
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:16,320
Line up one who does commercial and
mixed-use work before you find the building.

89
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:20,210
A residential conveyancer can slow
a commercial deal down by weeks.

90
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,350
And then there's speed.

91
00:04:21,350 --> 00:04:23,550
When the right building comes up, view it

92
00:04:23,550 --> 00:04:25,820
within a few days and
decide within a week.

93
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:28,360
Good buildings don't wait
for second viewings.

94
